<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JSE ADMITS CORONATION SEC. AS CORPORATE ENTITY.</title>
<headline>JSE ADMITS CORONATION SEC. AS CORPORATE ENTITY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coronation Securities (Pty) Ltd had been admitted as a corporate entity (limited liability) member of the Johannesburg Stock Exchange with effect from October 1, the JSE said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
